              "Brendan Smialowski | AFP | Getty Images\n\nPresident Donald Trump on Wednesday tweeted that he will delay increasing tariffs on $250 billion worth of Chinese goods from Oct. 1 to Oct. 15 as a \"gesture of good will\" to China.",
